msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Language: zh_Hans\n"

msgid "DashPlay"
msgstr "DashPlay"

msgid "CarPlay in the car's web browser. Set up Wi-Fi under Network → Wireless as usual; DashPlay hands one of these networks to the iPhone over Bluetooth, and the head unit opens the CarPlay page on the same network."
msgstr "在车机浏览器里用 CarPlay。WiFi 照常在「网络 → 无线」里设置；DashPlay 经蓝牙把其中一个 WiFi 交给 iPhone，车机连同一个 WiFi 打开 CarPlay 画面。"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "Not running"
msgstr "未运行"

msgid "Open"
msgstr "打开"

msgid "DashPlay settings (add iPhone)"
msgstr "DashPlay 设置（添加 iPhone）"

msgid "CarPlay screen"
msgstr "CarPlay 画面"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Wi-Fi handed to the iPhone"
msgstr "交给 iPhone 的 WiFi"

msgid "The iPhone joins this network for wireless CarPlay. The router's own access point works best; a network the router joins as a client must be in a firewall zone that accepts input."
msgstr "无线 CarPlay 时 iPhone 连这个 WiFi。最好用路由器自己的热点；路由器作为客户端连接的网络，必须在允许入站的防火墙区域里。"

msgid "Automatic (first access point, 5 GHz first)"
msgstr "自动（第一个热点，优先 5 GHz）"

msgid "access point"
msgstr "热点"

msgid "client"
msgstr "客户端"

msgid "Another router's Wi-Fi (enter below)"
msgstr "另一台路由器的 WiFi（在下面填写）"

msgid "Other router: Wi-Fi name"
msgstr "另一台路由器：WiFi 名称"

msgid "Set the other router up as an access point bridged into this router's LAN (no DHCP of its own, its LAN port or USB tethering in the bridge), so that phones and the head unit get their addresses from this router. Give its Wi-Fi a fixed channel."
msgstr "把另一台路由器设成桥接进本路由器局域网的无线接入点（关掉它自己的 DHCP，把它连本机的网口或 USB 共享网卡放进桥里），让手机和车机从本路由器拿地址。它的 WiFi 要设成固定信道。"

msgid "Other router: password type"
msgstr "另一台路由器：加密方式"

msgid "WPA2 personal (also WPA2/WPA3 mixed)"
msgstr "WPA2 个人（WPA2/WPA3 混合也选这个）"

msgid "WPA3 personal only"
msgstr "仅 WPA3 个人"

msgid "None (open)"
msgstr "不加密"

msgid "Other router: Wi-Fi password"
msgstr "另一台路由器：WiFi 密码"

msgid "Other router: Wi-Fi channel"
msgstr "另一台路由器：WiFi 信道"

msgid "The channel the other router actually uses, e.g. 149 or 6. Set a fixed one there, then check its status page or a phone's Wi-Fi details: some routers move the primary channel within the band (36 became 40 in a test). The iPhone is told this channel."
msgstr "另一台路由器实际在用的信道，例如 149 或 6。先在那边设成固定信道，再到它的状态页或手机的 WiFi 详情里看实际信道：有的路由器会在频段内换主信道（实测设 36 变成了 40）。会告诉 iPhone 这个信道。"

msgid "Other router: bridged into network"
msgstr "另一台路由器：桥接进的网络"

msgid "The interface of this router the other router is bridged into; DashPlay serves the CarPlay page on its address."
msgstr "另一台路由器桥接进本路由器的哪个接口；DashPlay 在这个接口的地址上提供 CarPlay 画面。"

msgid "Settings page port"
msgstr "设置页端口"

msgid "CarPlay screen port"
msgstr "CarPlay 画面端口"

msgid "The HTTPS port of the CarPlay page. Empty is 18443, or the port an older install saved; a change takes about a minute and interrupts CarPlay briefly. It must differ from the settings page port, 80, 443 and 7000."
msgstr "CarPlay 画面页的 HTTPS 端口。留空为 18443，或沿用旧版本保存的端口；修改后约 1 分钟生效，期间 CarPlay 会断一下。不能与设置页端口、80、443 和 7000 相同。"

msgid "Address name"
msgstr "访问名称"

msgid "The head unit opens the CarPlay page by this name, which the router answers on its own Wi-Fi; the page's certificate is made for it. On the router's access point the head unit opens %s"
msgstr "车机用这个名字打开 CarPlay 画面，名字由路由器在自己的 WiFi 里解析，画面的证书也是为它签的。车机连上路由器热点后打开 %s"

msgid "Public IPv6 address for the name"
msgstr "访问名称指向公网 IPv6"

msgid "Some head units refuse to open a LAN address. The name can also point at this router's own public IPv6 address: the head unit then sees a public address, while the picture still comes straight over the Wi-Fi. Needs a public IPv6 address on the router and IPv6 handed on to its Wi-Fi. \"Only\" helps to check that it works; the DashPlay settings page then opens by the LAN address, not by the name."
msgstr "有的车机不让打开局域网地址。访问名称可以同时指向本路由器自己的公网 IPv6 地址：车机看到的是公网地址，画面仍然直接走 WiFi，不经过外网、不耗流量。需要路由器有公网 IPv6，并把 IPv6 分给 WiFi 里的设备。「只用」便于确认这条路是否通；这时 DashPlay 设置页要用局域网地址打开，不能用访问名称。"

msgid "No (LAN address only)"
msgstr "不用（只用局域网地址）"

msgid "Also (beside the LAN address)"
msgstr "同时（与局域网地址并存）"

msgid "Only (instead of the LAN address)"
msgstr "只用（不给局域网地址）"

msgid "Release the iPhone after (seconds)"
msgstr "无人观看多久后释放 iPhone（秒）"

msgid "Without any page showing the picture for this long, wireless CarPlay ends and the iPhone stops sending its screen; opening the page invites it again (about 7 s). 0: never end it."
msgstr "没有任何网页在看画面超过这个时间，就结束无线 CarPlay，iPhone 不再持续发送画面、不会发热；之后打开网页会重新邀请（约 7 秒出画面）。填 0 表示永不结束。"

msgid "Own name (DuckDNS sub-domain)"
msgstr "自己的域名（DuckDNS 子域名）"

msgid "Only needed when the head unit's browser blocks the certificate warning with no way to continue. Sign up for free at duckdns.org, add a sub-domain and enter it with the token shown there. The address name then becomes that name (e.g. mycar.duckdns.org): DashPlay points it at this router and obtains a free Let's Encrypt certificate, renewed automatically, so the head unit opens the page without a warning. No port needs to be opened; the router needs internet access."
msgstr "只在车机浏览器拦截证书警告、没有「继续访问」时需要。在 duckdns.org 免费注册并建一个子域名，把子域名和页面上的 token 填在这里。访问名称会变成这个域名（如 mycar.duckdns.org）：DashPlay 把它指向本路由器，并申请免费的 Let’s Encrypt 正式证书、到期前自动续签，车机打开时不再有证书警告。不需要开放任何端口，路由器要能上网。"

msgid "DuckDNS token"
msgstr "DuckDNS token"

msgid "Usually not needed"
msgstr "一般用不到"

msgid "Try in this order: 1. The head unit warns that the certificate is not trusted: tap continue. 2. It offers no way to continue: install the DashPlay CA certificate on the head unit (DashPlay settings page, \"Download the box CA certificate\"), or, when it cannot install one, set an own name below. 3. It refuses to open a LAN address such as 192.168.x.x, even by name: for a Tesla turn on \"Tesla mode\" on the Car tab; for another head unit turn on \"Head unit refuses every LAN address\" below, or, when the router and the head unit have IPv6, set \"Public IPv6 address for the name\" to \"Also\"."
msgstr "按顺序试：① 车机提示证书不安全：点「继续访问」即可。② 没有「继续访问」：在车机上装 DashPlay 的 CA 证书（DashPlay 设置页「下载盒子 CA 证书」）；车机不让装，就在下面设置「自己的域名」。③ 车机不让打开 192.168.x.x 这类局域网地址（用名称也不行）：特斯拉在「车」标签打开「特斯拉模式」；其他车机勾选下面的「车机不让开任何局域网地址」；或者在路由器和车机都有 IPv6 时，把「访问名称指向公网 IPv6」选为「同时」。"

msgid "Head unit refuses every LAN address"
msgstr "车机不让开任何局域网地址"

msgid "For a head unit other than a Tesla whose browser opens no LAN address such as 192.168.x.x, not even by name (Tesla mode on the Car tab already does this, so this is hidden while it is on). Turned on, the router's own Wi-Fi network moves to %s (devices get 100.96.0.x): that range is not a private one, so such browsers open it, and the address name and own name follow. Afterwards open this admin page at %s and reconnect the head unit and phones to the Wi-Fi. Turning it off puts the previous address back."
msgstr "用于特斯拉以外、浏览器不让打开 192.168.x.x 这类局域网地址（用名称也不行）的车机（特斯拉在「车」标签打开「特斯拉模式」就已包含这一项，打开时这里会隐藏）。勾选后，路由器自己 WiFi 的网段改成 %s（设备拿到 100.96.0.x）：这段地址不算局域网地址，这类浏览器就能打开；访问名称和自己的域名会自动跟着改。改完请用 %s 打开本后台，车机和手机重新连一次 WiFi。取消勾选会改回原来的地址。"

msgid "Tesla mode"
msgstr "特斯拉模式"

msgid "For a Tesla. The router's Wi-Fi network moves to %s, which the Tesla browser opens (it refuses LAN addresses such as 192.168.x.x); turning it on also turns on the two Bluetooth switches on the Sound tab once (music, calls and Siri to the car; turning Music off makes the page the media source again, which the car may fight for); the fullscreen button works in the Tesla browser. Pair the iPhone with the Tesla over Bluetooth and pick it as the media source. In the Tesla's Wi-Fi settings turn on \"Remain connected in Drive\", else the picture stops out of Park. Afterwards open this admin page at %s and reconnect the car and phones to the Wi-Fi. Turning it off puts the previous address back."
msgstr "给特斯拉用。路由器 WiFi 的网段改成 %s，特斯拉浏览器才能打开（它不让开 192.168.x.x 这类局域网地址）；打开它时会一次性勾上「声音」里的两项蓝牙开关（音乐、通话和 Siri 交给车）；之后仍可在「声音」里单独关——关掉音乐后网页会重新当媒体源，车机可能和它抢媒体卡片；全屏按钮在特斯拉浏览器里可用。iPhone 用蓝牙连特斯拉，并在特斯拉里把媒体来源选成这部 iPhone。在特斯拉的 WiFi 设置里打开「行驶中保持连接」，否则出 P 挡画面就停。改完请用 %s 打开本后台，车和手机重新连一次 WiFi。取消勾选会改回原来的地址。"

msgid "Music over the car's Bluetooth"
msgstr "音乐走车机蓝牙"

msgid "Pair the iPhone with the car over Bluetooth and pick it as the media source: the steering wheel, media card and volume then work as with any phone. The CarPlay page shows the screen and plays navigation prompts, louder. If music ever comes without sound, choose the car as audio output in the iPhone's Control Center."
msgstr "iPhone 用蓝牙连车机，并在车机里把媒体来源选成这部 iPhone：方向盘切歌、媒体卡片、音量就和普通手机一样用。CarPlay 网页负责画面和导航播报（播报会放大）。偶尔放歌没声音时，在 iPhone 控制中心把音频输出选成车机。"

msgid "Calls and Siri over the car's Bluetooth"
msgstr "通话与 Siri 走车机蓝牙"

msgid "Calls and Siri use the car's own microphone and speakers through its Bluetooth (the iPhone must be paired with the car), not the CarPlay page. Worth a try when calls through the page echo."
msgstr "通话和 Siri 用车机自己的麦克风和喇叭（iPhone 要先用蓝牙连上车机），不经过 CarPlay 网页。网页通话有回声时可以试试。"

msgid "Network warning"
msgstr "网络提示"

msgid "Network check unavailable (service starting or stopped)."
msgstr "网络检查暂不可用（服务启动中或已停止）。"

msgid "Car"
msgstr "车"

msgid "Network"
msgstr "网络"

msgid "Car internet"
msgstr "车机上网"

msgid "iPhone"
msgstr "iPhone"

msgid "Sound"
msgstr "声音"

msgid "Own address"
msgstr "自己的网址"

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

msgid "Tesla offline checks"
msgstr "特斯拉离线联网检查"

msgid "The LAN stays online for the whole Tesla mode: the Tesla joins and opens CarPlay even without a SIM signal (cold start, basement). Only the upstream (Tesla music/maps) comes and goes; the CarPlay page never reconnects. Automatic is recommended; Always answer also hides the real checks when the upstream works; Real network only means the Tesla will not join without an upstream."
msgstr "特斯拉模式下局域网始终保持在线：哪怕没有 SIM 信号（冷启动、地库），特斯拉也能连上 WiFi 打开 CarPlay；只有上游外网（特斯拉自带音乐、地图）随信号通断，CarPlay 画面不会重连。推荐选「自动」；「始终代答」在有外网时也挡住真实联网检查；「仅用真实网络」在没有外网时特斯拉不会连上此 WiFi。"

msgid "Automatic (recommended): LAN always online, upstream switches by itself"
msgstr "自动（推荐）：局域网常在线，外网自动切换"

msgid "Always answer (even with upstream)"
msgstr "始终代答（有外网时也代答）"

msgid "Real network only (no join without upstream)"
msgstr "仅用真实网络（无外网时不连）"

msgid "Download diagnostics from the DashPlay settings page. Changes take about one minute and interrupt CarPlay briefly."
msgstr "在 DashPlay 设置页下载诊断记录。修改后约 1 分钟生效，期间 CarPlay 会断一下。"

msgid "Program update"
msgstr "程序更新"

msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "正在读取…"

msgid "Check for a new version daily"
msgstr "每天检查新版本"

msgid "Only shows that there is one; nothing is installed until you click \"Update now\". Before updating, the iPhones, certificates and settings are backed up; a version that does not start is replaced by the previous one."
msgstr "只提示有新版本，点「立即升级」才会安装。升级前会备份 iPhone、证书和设置；新版本起不来会自动退回原来的版本。"

msgid "Download mirror"
msgstr "下载镜像"

msgid "Tried when GitHub cannot be reached. Releases are signed, so a mirror cannot change what is installed. Empty: the built-in mirror; \"none\": GitHub only."
msgstr "连不上 GitHub 时改用这个地址前缀下载。发布带签名，镜像改不了装进来的内容。留空用内置的镜像；填 none 只用 GitHub。"

msgid "Updating:"
msgstr "正在升级："

msgid "About 2–5 minutes; CarPlay is interrupted meanwhile."
msgstr "约 2–5 分钟，期间 CarPlay 会断开。"

msgid "Last update:"
msgstr "上次升级："

msgid "Last update did not finish:"
msgstr "上次升级没有完成："

msgid "Checking for updates failed:"
msgstr "检查更新没有成功："

msgid "New version %s"
msgstr "有新版本 %s"

msgid "(installed: %s)"
msgstr "（当前 %s）"

msgid "an older version"
msgstr "较旧版本"

msgid "This version changes the system: update with the firmware image as the installation guide describes."
msgstr "这一版改了系统，不能在线升级：请按装机说明用刷机包升级。"

msgid "Up to date:"
msgstr "已是最新："

msgid "Check now"
msgstr "立即检查"

msgid "Update DashPlay now? CarPlay is interrupted for a few minutes."
msgstr "现在升级 DashPlay？CarPlay 会断开几分钟。"

msgid "Update now"
msgstr "立即升级"

msgid "Last checked: %s"
msgstr "上次检查：%s"

msgid "Media music"
msgstr "媒体音乐"

msgid "Navigation prompts"
msgstr "导航播报"

msgid "Alert sounds"
msgstr "提示音"

msgid "Phone calls"
msgstr "通话"

msgid "Bluetooth"
msgstr "蓝牙"

msgid "Choose CarPlay or the iPhone’s Bluetooth device. Shared with Box Settings in CarPlay; changing it reconnects CarPlay. Bluetooth volume is adjusted on the car or headphones. Select the iPhone audio output when needed."
msgstr "选择 CarPlay 或 iPhone 的蓝牙设备。与 CarPlay 内的盒子设置同步；修改后 CarPlay 会重连。蓝牙音量请在车机或耳机上调整，必要时在 iPhone 选择输出。"

msgid "For a Tesla. The router's Wi-Fi network moves to %s, which the Tesla browser opens (it refuses LAN addresses such as 192.168.x.x); pick the Tesla as the output for music, Siri and calls in the iPhone Control Center while navigation prompts stay louder on the page (to send no sound through CarPlay at all, use the Sound tab or Box Settings on the CarPlay screen); the fullscreen button works in the Tesla browser. Pair the iPhone with the Tesla over Bluetooth and pick it as the media source. In the Tesla's Wi-Fi settings turn on \"Remain connected in Drive\", else the picture stops out of Park. Afterwards open this admin page at %s and reconnect the car and phones to the Wi-Fi. Turning it off puts the previous address back."
msgstr "适用于特斯拉：将路由器 WiFi 网段改为 %s（特斯拉浏览器不能访问 192.168.x.x 等局域网地址）。音乐、Siri 和通话在 iPhone 控制中心选特斯拉输出，导航播报留在网页并会放大（想让所有声音都不走 CarPlay，在「声音」页或 CarPlay 画面里的「盒子设置」改）；全屏按钮适配特斯拉浏览器。请将 iPhone 蓝牙连接车机，并选为媒体来源。在特斯拉 WiFi 设置中开启行驶时保持连接，否则挂挡后会断开。随后在 %s 打开后台，并将车机和手机重新连接 WiFi。关闭后恢复原网段。"

msgid "Media, Siri and calls"
msgstr "媒体、Siri 和通话"

msgid "These three share one output choice. Select CarPlay or Bluetooth on the iPhone too. Navigation has its own output choice; alerts follow the iPhone notification route. Shared with Box Settings in CarPlay."
msgstr "这三项共用一个输出选择，请同时在 iPhone 选择 CarPlay 或蓝牙输出。导航可以单独选择输出；提示音按 iPhone 的通知路径输出。与 CarPlay 盒子设置同步。"

msgid "Sound output"
msgstr "声音输出"

msgid "Keep on CarPlay"
msgstr "留在 CarPlay"

msgid "Not through CarPlay"
msgstr "不走 CarPlay"

msgid "Keep on CarPlay: choose where music, Siri and calls play in the iPhone Control Center (the output icon on the music card); navigation prompts stay on the CarPlay page. Not through CarPlay: every sound, navigation included, plays on the iPhone or its Bluetooth device, and CarPlay is no longer listed in the Control Center. Shared with Box Settings in CarPlay; CarPlay reconnects briefly after a change."
msgstr "留在 CarPlay：音乐、Siri 和通话从哪出，在 iPhone 控制中心（音乐卡片右上角的输出图标）选；导航播报一直在 CarPlay 网页。不走 CarPlay：所有声音（含导航）都由 iPhone 自己或它连的蓝牙播放，控制中心里不会再有 CarPlay。与 CarPlay 画面里的盒子设置同步；修改后 CarPlay 会短暂重连。"
